Subject: New service account with mailbox and Power Automate licence: Private Banker Meeting Scheduler (POC)
Summary
Please create a dedicated, non-personal service account for the Private Banker Meeting Scheduler. The account will own the solution's Power Automate flows and their connections, and its own mailbox will receive customer replies about meeting requests. No separate shared mailbox is needed.
Business justification
The scheduler's automated flows run when no banker is signed in: when a customer replies to a meeting proposal, when a booking needs confirming, and on a daily housekeeping run. Automated flows run as the account that owns their connections, so they need a dedicated account rather than an individual's. This also stops the solution depending on one person's account, which would break if they left or changed role. The account will not write to CRM; CRM records are written by the app as the signed-in banker.
